<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <meta charset="utf-8" />
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
        <title><%= title %></title>
        <style>
            :root {
                color-scheme: light dark;
                --line: #8883;
                --accent: #1f7a5a;
            }
            body {
                font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
                max-width: 62rem;
                margin: 2rem auto;
                padding: 0 1rem;
                line-height: 1.5;
            }
            h1 {
                margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
            }
            .lede {
                color: #666;
                margin-top: 0;
            }
            section {
                border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
                margin-top: 2rem;
                padding-top: 1rem;
            }
            article {
                border: 1px solid var(--line);
                border-radius: 8px;
                padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
                margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
            }
            article h3 {
                margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
                font-size: 1rem;
            }
            article ul {
                margin: 0.25rem 0;
                padding-left: 1.25rem;
            }
            code {
                font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;
                font-size: 0.9em;
            }
            #panel {
                display: grid;
                gap: 0.75rem;
                border: 1px solid var(--line);
                border-radius: 8px;
                padding: 1rem;
            }
            .row {
                display: flex;
                flex-wrap: wrap;
                gap: 0.5rem;
                align-items: end;
            }
            fieldset {
                border: 1px solid var(--line);
                border-radius: 8px;
            }
            legend {
                padding: 0 0.35rem;
                font-weight: 600;
            }
            label {
                display: block;
                font-size: 0.8rem;
                color: #666;
            }
            input {
                font: inherit;
                padding: 0.25rem 0.4rem;
            }
            button {
                font: inherit;
                padding: 0.3rem 0.7rem;
                border-radius: 6px;
                border: 1px solid var(--line);
                background: transparent;
                cursor: pointer;
            }
            button:hover {
                border-color: var(--accent);
            }
            #log {
                font-family: ui-monospace, monospace;
                font-size: 0.8rem;
                white-space: pre-wrap;
                word-break: break-all;
                max-height: 30rem;
                overflow: auto;
                background: #8881;
                border-radius: 8px;
                padding: 0.75rem;
                margin: 0;
            }
            .note {
                color: #666;
                font-size: 0.85rem;
            }
        </style>
    </head>
    <body>
        <header>
            <h1><%= title %></h1>
            <p class="lede">
                Six authentication modes, one process: opaque cookie sessions, JWT access + refresh tokens, a role matrix
                over HTTP and sockets, login rate limiting, durable LibSQL sessions, and OIDC authorization-code + PKCE
                against an issuer embedded in this server.
            </p>
            <p class="note">
                Demo accounts: <code>admin</code> (role <code>admin</code>) and <code>alice</code> (role
                <code>user</code>), password <code>demo</code>; the federated account <code>oidc-demo</code> exists only
                through the embedded OIDC issuer.
            </p>
        </header>

        <main id="playground" aria-live="polite">
            <section>
                <h2>Interactive panel loading…</h2>
                <p class="note">
                    The buttons come from <code>/static/client.js</code>. Everything this page documents is also
                    reachable with <code>curl</code> — see the README's transcripts.
                </p>
            </section>
        </main>

        <section id="matrix">
            <h2>The modes</h2>
            <% for (const mode of modes) { %>
            <article id="<%= mode.id %>">
                <h3><%= mode.title %></h3>
                <ul>
                    <% for (const endpoint of mode.endpoints) { %>
                    <li><code><%= endpoint %></code></li>
                    <% } %>
                </ul>
                <p><%= mode.demonstrates %></p>
            </article>
            <% } %>
        </section>

        <script type="module" src="/static/client.js"></script>
    </body>
</html>
